# Compiled output
/dist
/dist-player
/tmp
/out-tsc
/bazel-out
/public/zip
# DEPLOY-005: build-emitted per-era catalog SLICES (fetched from the proxied catalog at build time;
# witness-derived data per REF-001 → NOT committed; gen-slices regenerates them on the Cloudflare build).
/public/mekbay/slim
# DEPLOY-007: full catalog JSON mirrored same-origin at build time (units/equipment2/quirks/factions/
# eras/units_sources) so the market full-catalog never touches db.mekbay.com. Build-fetched, REF-001 → NOT committed.
/public/mekbay/*.json
# (content-forge/mul/ilclan/allowlist.json) → served same-origin. Build-emitted, like the slices → NOT committed.
/public/mekbay/mul-ilclan
# DEPLOY-002 P4-prep: the generated unit SPRITES are committed (baked) so a clean cloud clone
# (Cloudflare Pages) builds a working app WITHOUT the gitignored mm-data (the T-006 dependency).
# They are MekBay GPL display assets (unit icons), NOT the REF-001-gated rulebooks/witnesses.
# gen-sprites still regenerates them when mm-data IS present (MM_DATA_PATH); absent → it no-ops + these stand.

